How to attribute
----------------

A sufficient credit looks like:

  "POST TITLE" by Davide Macario, licensed under CC BY 4.0.
  Source: https://blog.example.com/posts/post-slug/

If you modified the material, indicate it like so:

  Adapted from "POST TITLE" by Davide Macario, licensed under CC BY 4.0.
  Source: https://blog.example.com/posts/post-slug/


